Cursed ?oGD detects traps as gold, but the gold disappears when you
get in line of sight.  A confused ?oGD actually detects traps
themselves, and gives you the message "You feel entrapped" if there
are any traps to detect (which there always are on the planes up
through water).

Also, I don't know what your original comment about a wand of
cancellation was implying.  The buc status of a /oCanc has nothing to
do with its effects.  It will always remove all blessings/curses, set
enhancement to +0 where appropriate, and set number of charges to -1. 
Zapping a wand at -1 will make it disappear.  A cursed wand (any
cursed wand) has a small chance of exploding when you zap it instead
of working properly.

